            0.086,
            0.883,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": "**Q.6. A farmer has a rectangular field having length 230 m and breadth 160 m. He wants to fence it with 3 rounds of rope as shown. What is the total length of rope needed?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.131,
            0.521,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Perimeter of the field = 780 m Total length of the rope needed = 2340 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.212,
            0.217,
            0.229
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Section 6.1"
        },
        {
